        "foundedYear": "1995",
        "businessSummary": "As one of the world's leading integrated telecom providers, Airtel is shaping the digital future across 17 countries, connecting over half a billion people with its digital network. The company's core vision is to enrich the lives of its customers and aims to win them for life by providing an exceptional experience. It is built on a strong foundation of Digital Infrastructure, Digital Experience, and Digital Services to transform connectivity and deliver a brilliant customer experience. For individuals and families, the company brings people together with seamless high-speed connectivity bundled with a diverse selection of digital content and entertainment. For enterprises, it offers robust connectivity powered by terrestrial and global fiber networks, modern data centres, and customized digital solutions. As India's number one integrated communications service provider, its network covers over 97% of the nation's population, ensuring widespread connectivity.",
