        "businessSummary": "Larsen & Toubro is a professionally managed Indian multinational corporation dedicated to achieving complete customer satisfaction and improving value for its shareholders. The company's vision is to have an innovative, entrepreneurial, and empowered team that consistently generates value and meets global benchmarks. It actively promotes a culture defined by caring, trust, and continuous learning to meet the expectations of all its stakeholders and society. The company's journey is defined by excellence across a diversified portfolio that includes infrastructure, energy, manufacturing, and services. The company is advancing towards a sustainable future by embedding decarbonisation into its strategic roadmap across its various business verticals. Financially, the company shows robust health, with its order book reaching a record ₹5.79 lakh crore, marking a 22% increase.",
