        "ceo": "Sanjiv Puri",
        "managingDirector": "Sanjiv Puri",
        "foundedYear": "1910",
        "businessSummary": "ITC Limited is one of India's foremost private sector enterprises, operating across agriculture, manufacturing, and services to contribute significantly to the national economy. The company's core vision is to create substantial societal value through a model of 'Responsible Competitiveness,' ensuring business growth also benefits society and the environment. Guided by its 'Nation First' credo, ITC is committed to empowering farmers, building world-class Indian brands, and tackling challenges like climate change and livelihood generation. Its main businesses include Fast-Moving Consumer Goods (FMCG) with over 25 world-class brands, a pioneering hotel chain, and leadership in Paperboards and Agri Business. Through its 'ITC Next' strategy, the company is building future-ready businesses by focusing on digital technology, sustainability, and consumer-centric innovation to drive growth. A global leader in sustainability, it is the only enterprise of its kind in the world to be water, carbon, and solid waste recycling positive for over a decade.",
