        "ceo": "Amitabh Chaudhry",
        "managingDirector": "Amitabh Chaudhry",
        "foundedYear": "1993",
        "businessSummary": "Axis Bank is India's third-largest private sector bank, providing a complete suite of banking products and financial services covering retail, wholesale, and treasury operations. Its guiding vision is to be the preferred financial services provider, excelling in customer service delivery through insightful employees and the smart application of modern technology. Core values of Customer Centricity, Ethics, Ownership, Transparency, and Teamwork shape every interaction and decision the company makes across its operations. The bank's 'Growth, Profitability, and Sustainability' (GPS) strategy focuses on accelerating deposit growth, achieving leadership in key market segments, and ensuring robust corporate governance. Operations are supported by a vast domestic network of 5,879 locations and a strong 'Bharat Banking' franchise to serve rural and semi-urban India. Demonstrating its ESG commitment, the bank exceeded its sustainable wholesale lending target of ₹30,000 crores well ahead of the 2026 deadline, achieving ₹48,412 crores by 2025.",
