        "ceo": "C K Venkataraman",
        "managingDirector": "C K Venkataraman",
        "foundedYear": "1984",
        "businessSummary": "Established in 1984 as a joint venture between the Tata Group and TIDCO, Titan has grown into a prominent name in the integrated lifestyle sector. Its core vision is to create elevating experiences for the people it touches and to make a significant impact on the world. The company pursues its goals through a pioneering spirit and a caring, value-driven culture that fosters innovation and high performance. Titan has built a strong and diverse portfolio of iconic brands in Jewellery, Watches & Wearables, EyeCare, Fragrances & Women's Bags, and Indian Dresswear. Under its 'Pragati' vision, the company combines care for the planet, inclusive growth, and transparent, ethical governance in its long-term strategy. The company has a vast footprint with over 3,312 stores, a retail area of 47 lakh square feet, and 11 manufacturing facilities.",
