        "foundedYear": "1945",
        "businessSummary": "Starting its journey eight decades ago, the Mahindra Group has evolved into a global federation of companies, with Mahindra & Mahindra Ltd. as its flagship mobility and farm solutions entity. The group's core purpose is to drive positive change that helps communities rise, with a clear focus on leading in environmental and social governance. It offers an extensive lineup of vehicles, including authentic SUVs, sturdy pickups, and light commercial vehicles, alongside a dominant position in the tractor segment. The company has expanded its portfolio to include electric vehicles, two-wheelers, power generators, and construction equipment to cater to a changing audience. Mahindra & Mahindra is recognized as India's number one SUV company by revenue market share and the number one Electric 3-Wheeler company.",
