        "foundedYear": "1989",
        "businessSummary": "Power Grid Corporation of India Limited is a leading transmission company globally and a 'Maharatna' Public Sector Enterprise of the Government of India. Its vision is to become a world-class, integrated, global transmission company with dominant leadership in emerging power markets, ensuring reliability, safety, and economy. A key part of its mission is to set superior standards in capital project management and operations for the industry. POWERGRID's primary role is to lead India's power transmission network, facilitating the nationwide transfer of electricity from generation sources to distribution centers. Beyond its core transmission operations, the company has diversified into telecommunications and consultancy services, thereby expanding its business portfolio and value proposition. The company achieved a transmission system availability of 99.85%, which is one of the highest rates recorded globally.",
