        "foundedYear": "2000",
        "businessSummary": "UltraTech Cement is the primary cement company of the Aditya Birla Group and a powerhouse in building solutions with a value of $8.4 billion. Its main vision is to establish itself as the foremost leader in providing comprehensive building solutions to its customers across the board. The company's mission is founded on four key principles, including sustainability, innovation, team empowerment, and a strong focus on customer needs. Over the years, it has evolved from being just a cement maker into a complete provider of building materials and services. The business operates an extensive distribution network to ensure that its products and services are reliably delivered to projects throughout the country. Highlighting its vast production scale, the company manufactures 2.4 billion bags of cement every single year for the market.",
