        "managingDirector": "Ashish Khanna",
        "foundedYear": "2015",
        "businessSummary": "Adani Green Energy Limited stands as India's largest and most rapidly expanding independent power producer focused purely on renewable energy. Its vision is to be a world-class leader in businesses that enrich lives and contribute to building national infrastructure through sustainable value creation. The company's core mission is to address India's pressing needs for energy security and decarbonisation with major investments in clean energy generation. AGEL's primary business involves developing, owning, and operating large-scale, grid-connected solar, wind, and hybrid renewable power plants across the country. The company is also pioneering energy storage solutions, including hydro-pumped storage projects and large-scale Battery Energy Storage Systems (BESS). The company is developing the world's largest single-location 30 GW renewable energy project in Khavda, setting a global benchmark in the sector.",
