        "ceo": "Srinivas Pallia",
        "managingDirector": "Srinivas Pallia",
        "foundedYear": "1945",
        "businessSummary": "With over 75 years of innovation, Wipro is a purpose-driven global technology services and consulting firm, helping businesses navigate a rapidly changing world. The company's vision is to be a trusted partner for its clients, guiding their transformation with consulting and AI-powered solutions to make them industry leaders. As part of its mission, the company commits to being a catalyst for building a just, equitable, humane, and sustainable society for all. It leverages a broad portfolio of services in consulting, design, engineering, and operations to solve the most complex digital transformation challenges for its clients. Its 'ai360' strategy focuses on using AI to improve its own functions, enhance client services, and reimagine business with AI-powered solutions. The firm employs more than 230,000 experts across six continents, providing solutions that enable customers, colleagues, and communities to prosper globally.",
